<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Marks the "Upcoming appointments" card on the dashboard: a calendar page.

    A calendar rather than the vet category's medical cross, deliberately. The cross already means
    "this is a vet task" on every checklist row in the app; reusing it as the heading of a card
    *made of* vet tasks would say the same thing twice. The calendar says the different thing the
    card is actually about — that these are dated, and still ahead.
-->
